Hello Alsa and Qt users

Version 0.10.0 of QasMixer is now available.

This is a polishing release

Changes:

* Start minimized if a session is restored
* Alsa configuration browser in a separate top menu entry
* Slider style tweaks - curves instead of triangles
* Check button style tweaks


Homepage with more informations and screenshots
http://xwmw.org/qasmixer

Files are hosted at sourceforge
http://sourceforge.net/projects/qasmixer/


Happy volume changing!

